by\"> Originally posted by <strong>Someone in the custom kith thread</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b>Mellowmunchers</b>: Those changelings who take after the lazy and easygoing domestic animals with a perchance to lazily munch away at just about anything the come across, such as Cows, Pigs, Goats and the like. The Mellowmuncher blessing is Cudcrunching: 9 again on survival rolls, and may spend one Glamour to reroll failed Survival dice.</span></div> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-09T04:51:05-07:00","id":223127,"title":"","content":"Ooh, good find. XD I'd forgotten that one. Especially how it mentions <i>all three</i>* of our characters' species.<br /> <br /> Could be applicable to all three, though I suppose -- if assigning Kiths for dining -- Roteater works just slightly better for Max. He could use those bonuses to resisting poison and disease, given his sort of &quot;food.&quot; It even offers a little 9-again for scrounging up useful stuff, so hey, the lucky pig's got his truffle-hunting covered. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Hm, Cleareyes (Keensnout?) is another good fit... Eh, let's not settle on one or both for now; always the chance he could pick up a non-Beast Kith, depending.<br /> <br /> * The Ox was called the Cow in at least the dub of Fruit's Basket (when the &quot;Cow&quot; was a dude), so that's close enough for me!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://avatarcomic.net/exalted-wiki/Exalted_3E:What_We_Know\" target=\"_blank\">The EX3 What We Know Wiki</a>, courtesy of Marin and JMobius<br /> <a href=\"http://nishkriya.com\" target=\"_blank\">Nishkriya, the EX3 Freelancer Quotes Tracker</a>, courtesy of Anathema and Moonwolf<br /> <a href=\"http://forums.whitewolfarchive.com/\" target=\"_blank\">The White Wolf Forum Archive</a>, courtesy of The Dark Wizard and Sanctaphrax (see <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/PhilippeSaner?u=159709\" target=\"_blank\">its Patreon</a>) <hr />Arrghus: There's also the Shepherd of the North Star, busily guiding the one thing in all the heavens that <i>doesn't move</i>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/558-gaius","name":"Gaius","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2028"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-10T21:15:04-07:00","id":224835,"title":"","content":"Hmm... Max and Nate seem like they may be... occupied for a bit, there, at the waterfall. Hope you're not getting bored, Cire. ^_^o<br /> <br /> Hey, Nyrufa, perhaps you could work with Cire to bring something up at Jessica's brook? For this RP, I think it's great to take a more hands-off approach when the PCs are interacting, but a little extra attention seems like a good idea if one PC is going solo for a bit.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://avatarcomic.net/exalted-wiki/Exalted_3E:What_We_Know\" target=\"_blank\">The EX3 What We Know Wiki</a>, courtesy of Marin and JMobius<br /> <a href=\"http://nishkriya.com\" target=\"_blank\">Nishkriya, the EX3 Freelancer Quotes Tracker</a>, courtesy of Anathema and Moonwolf<br /> <a href=\"http://forums.whitewolfarchive.com/\" target=\"_blank\">The White Wolf Forum Archive</a>, courtesy of The Dark Wizard and Sanctaphrax (see <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/PhilippeSaner?u=159709\" target=\"_blank\">its Patreon</a>) <hr />Arrghus: There's also the Shepherd of the North Star, busily guiding the one thing in all the heavens that <i>doesn't move</i>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/558-gaius","name":"Gaius","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2028"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-10T21:25:55-07:00","id":224840,"title":"","content":"Not at all! Please notice that I had Jessica arrive with more than enough time having passed for.... nature to have taken its course. I have not yet once been bored in this game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-10T21:26:28-07:00","id":224841,"title":"","content":"Although maybe Max is still busy <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-10T22:36:32-07:00","id":224887,"title":"","content":"Well I know Nate is !","signature":"<hr c