ee the illusion for what it is, before Max and Nate are drugged?<br /> <br /> Up to you guys, really. I don't feel like continuing this part if you're all uncomfortable with it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-11T11:57:37-07:00","id":225196,"title":"","content":"I will happily edit as directed. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-11T13:09:57-07:00","id":225245,"title":"","content":"It's not really that I'm unconfortable with it, it's just that we had an opportunity for a good scene (I'm pretty sure Max and Nate would have had a fight over the later's indulgence) and the time skip kinda ruined it. However, I can still proceed with the rp as it is currently, I have the inspiration for this.<br /> I think we should wait for Gaius's decision on this. He's the one whose character suffers the most from this.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-11T18:10:25-07:00","id":225483,"title":"","content":"Ah. Well. Hunh. Sorry, didn't mean to make a fuss. ^_^o Thanks for being very understanding, though, everybody! Like evilmarmelade, I was thinking there might be a good opportunity for a scene, so I thought I would have more time to adjust/decide what Max ultimately did. I can see how my last post seemed to paint a clear trajectory, there, but I wanted to see if the little guy got talked and tempted all the way into things with the lovely ladies/not-ladies, or wound up getting cold feet.* I don't have any objections to his getting drugged, mind; he might wind up chickening out or resisting the women with the Power of Awkward or puppy/piglet love for Karen or whatever, but it's basically certain he wouldn't be able to pass up the mushrooms.<br /> <br /> * Or what have you.<br /> <br /> And Cire, no apology needed! Like I said, the trajectory would have seemed clear, and I had just made that post in this thread about maybe getting the three of them back into the same place again. Honestly, rereading my OOC post makes &quot;timeskip&quot; seem an even more reasonable presumption. XD The point is, I don't want this making you or anyone else nervous or reluctant to do things, just because signals weren't sent, received, or otherwise perfect in this case.<br /> <br /> As for turning back the clock, it might be fun to play it out, though we don't have to. If we do stick to the present, though, I'd rather retcon out that Max got it on; it feels like it's a big enough developmental decision for him that I'd really like to be the one to pull the trigger on it, should it happen. Note that I'm not strictly opposed to unpleasant surprises of any sort; I mean, signing up to RP a character's Durance in Arcada is rather like signing up to play &quot;Unpleasant Surprises: The Game.&quot; <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> And Nyrufa's been doing a good job of that, while on the topic.<br /> <br /> Whatever happens, thank you for the understanding here, and any willingness to be accommodating!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://avatarcomic.net/exalted-wiki/Exalted_3E:What_We_Know\" target=\"_blank\">The EX3 What We Know Wiki</a>, courtesy of Marin and JMobius<br /> <a href=\"http://nishkriya.com\" target=\"_blank\">Nishkriya, the EX3 Freelancer Quotes Tracker</a>, courtesy of Anathema and Moonwolf<br /> <a href=\"http://forums.whitewolfarchive.com/\" target=\"_blank\">The White Wolf Forum Archive</a>, courtesy of The Dark Wizard and Sanctaphrax (see <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/PhilippeSaner?u=159709\" target=\"_blank\">its Patreon</a>) <hr />Arrghus: There's also the Shepherd of the North Star, busily guiding the one thing in all the heavens that <i>doesn't move</i>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/558-gaius","name":"Gaius","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2028"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-11T18:21:49-07:00","id":225507,"title":"","content":"My suggestion would be that we take our cues from movies. We leave Jessica pinned by three fish things, ans whoever posts next can do something like, &quot;Sometime earlier....&quot; Then play the scene out fully. I will be as entertained as anyone else to see what happens. When Max and Nate are &quot;caught up&quot; then perhaps anything that needs to be edited can be.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-11T20:24:15-07:00","id":225610,"title":"","content":"Well Piggy doesn't have to have fornicated with the women, he could still be drugged out of his mind on magic mushrooms while Goaty got all the love. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> Basically the scene is like this =<br /> <br /> Mushrooms release hallucinogenic spores, effecting the minds of any males infected by them. This leads them to perceive what Max and Nate witnessed. Females, on the other hand, see through the deception as was the case with Jessica.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-11T21:20:32-07:00","id":225631,"title":"","content":"So, how do we play it out? The flashback suggestion seems good enough.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-11T21:34:18-07:00","id":225633,"title":"","content":"Aye, makes sense. And agreed, the flashback idea's a good one. Nyrufa, did you want to launch into a short description of the joint hallucination's reaction to Nate and Max's respective entries, or should we just dive in?<br /> <br /> Also, thanks again.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://avatarcomic.net/exalted-wiki/Exalted_3E:What_We_Know\" target=\"_blank\">The EX3 What We Know Wiki</a>, courtesy of Marin and JMobius<br /> <a href=\"http://nishkriya.com\" target=\"_blank\">Nishkriya, the EX3 Freelancer Quotes Tracker</a>, courtesy of Anathema and Moonwolf<br /> <a href=\"http://forums.whitewolfarchive.com/\" target=\"_blank\">The White Wolf Forum Archive</a>, courtesy of The Dark Wizard and Sanctaphrax (see <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/PhilippeSaner?u=159709\" target=\"_blank\">its Patreon</a>) <hr />Arrghus: There's also the Shepherd of the North Star, busily guiding the one thing in all the heavens that <i>doesn't move</i>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/558-gaius","name":"Gaius","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2028"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-11T21:56:39-07:00","id":225644,"title":"","content":"Oh, I forgot : I won't be able to post until late tonight. I'm off to work in half an hour and I shouldn't be home until at least 13 hours.<br /> <br /> (Can't really make the time conversion here, sorry!)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.t