ank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-13T12:25:53-07:00","id":227228,"title":"","content":"Thanks for the flashbacks. I've been waiting to write this kind of scene for days, and I'm really glad I get to do that.<br /> <br /> Also! I'll have a very long day at work tomorrow (6 a.m. to 7 p.m. ...Ugh) and a family dinner in the evening, so I shouldn't be able to post tomorrow until very late.<br /> <br /> However, I'm still on the computer for the next two hours or so.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":2016,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","user":"Evilmarmelade","date":". 08-13-2014, 05:18 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-13T21:23:58-07:00","id":227572,"title":"","content":"Aye, this is an interesting segment. Max seems to have found his way into a different sort of degradation: a pampered pet compared to Nate's lustful beast.<br /> <br /> Sorry I missed your window in there, but I'm pretty sure I was at work myself when you posted. ^_^o Rrrreally wouldn't have had the chance, even if I wasn't kind of a slow poster. Here's hoping the long day goes (went?) better than you seem inclined to think!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://avatarcomic.net/exalted-wiki/Exalted_3E:What_We_Know\" target=\"_blank\">The EX3 What We Know Wiki</a>, courtesy of Marin and JMobius<br /> <a href=\"http://nishkriya.com\" target=\"_blank\">Nishkriya, the EX3 Freelancer Quotes Tracker</a>, courtesy of Anathema and Moo