 Max's opinion. I really don't know if he should accept the contract or not.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-26T11:20:41-07:00","id":241507,"title":"","content":"My understanding of Journey to the West is pretty limited, too. &gt;.&gt; There's a monk who Son Wukong is supposed to be guarding, and there's at least one more companion the group picks up, but that's about it. So... Yeah, might work nicely as a broad motif, but the particulars would be messy. Not that knowing nothing about it would stop a True Fae who decided to do something on the topic.<br /> <br /> And gotcha. Thanks for the concern, but I think I can manage, just... not much I'll be able to do until I get home tonight. You're welcome to go ahead of me, but I'll definitely be giving Max's response when I can get off work. I know that he'll be very iffy about the whole thing and I don't expect him to go for it. But we'll see where things proceed when I'm in a position to post, particularly if Nate has a different reaction. Apologies again for the relative absence on my end.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://avatarcomic.net/exalted-wiki/Exalted_3E:What_We_Know\" target=\"_blank\">The EX3 What We Know Wiki</a>, courtesy of Marin and JMobius<br /> <a href=\"http://nishkriya.com\" target=\"_blank\">Nishkriya, the EX3 Freelancer Quotes Tracker</a>, courtesy of Anathema and Moonwolf<br /> <a href=\"http://forums.whitewolfarchive.com/\" target=\"_blank\">The White Wolf Forum Archive</a>, cour