eonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-17T03:46:13-07:00","id":258903,"title":"","content":"We all put a blurb about our character in this thread at the beginning, with his basic description (mental and physical). It may help Nyrufa tailoring the ordeals to Derek.<br /> <br /> Or, you could wait until the scene is over and we had a good look at him.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-17T04:02:17-07:00","id":258910,"title":"","content":"Yeah, I may make one of those blurbs anyway. I was mostly thinking about all the things you posted up until now, the deal with the failed scape and all that before getting to the ranch. Where did he get the spear and those things.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-17T09:07:07-07:00","id":259006,"title":"","content":"This game has gotten even more awesome! So great to have you in it, Thorbes.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-17T10:20:21-07:00","id":259031,"title":"","content":"Welcome aboard, Thorbes! ^_^ And quite the flashy entrance Derrick wound up making.<br /> <br /> A blurb for a physical description and real-world grounding would be welcome, though I can see some fun with keeping his Arcadian exploits a secret for now. You could always consider PMing some thoughts to Nyrufa, though. Our ST would probably appreciate not worrying about introducing elements that contradict whatever background you have in mind, never mind getting ideas to spring on the simian.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://avatarcomic.net/exalted-wiki/Exalted_3E:What_We_Know\" target=\"_blank\">The EX3 What We Know Wiki</a>, courtesy of Marin and JMobius<br /> <a href=\"http://nishkriya.com\" target=\"_blank\">Nishkriya, the EX3 Freelancer Quotes Tracker</a>, courtesy of Anathema and Moonwolf<br /> <a href=\"http://forums.whitewolfarchive.com/\" target=\"_blank\">The White Wolf Forum Archive</a>, courtesy of The Dark Wizard and Sanctaphrax (see <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/PhilippeSaner?u=159709\" target=\"_blank\">its Patreon</a>) <hr />Arrghus: There's also the Shepherd of the North Star, busily guiding the one thing in all the heavens that <i>doesn't move</i>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/558-gaius","name":"Gaius","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2028"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-17T12:43:03-07:00","id":259111,"title":"","content":"Ok, a quick summary:<br /> <br /> Derek was a professor of semiotics at the University (wich one? He doesn't remember anymore). He bought the monkey figurine because he likes to collect examples of artistry of diferent cultures and beliefs and thought it would be a great addition to his collection. That happend about a month or so ago.<br /> <br /> He saw the failed escape atempt by the ox and the pig and decided to keep a low profile until he managed to understand his situation better. After they where dropped in the ranch, he followed them around, keep a good distance. He was tempted to intrude when the goat and pig went wild but everything happend too fast for him to react. Ashamed of what could have happened,he wander around the place and tried to make a weapon to protect himself from all those crazy &quot;people&quot; around. He figured being a monkey he had it better than everybody else as he was not that far from human so he tried to took a branch from a tree to sharpen it to make a spear.<br /> <br /> And failed.<br /> <br /> He failed again and again.<br /> <br /> It seemed that the place refused to let him craft anything out of it. Then he remebered the &quot;pact&quot; he saw the ox and the goat make and decided to try something similar. He bargained the ability to craft things, he was not sure who or what he was bargaining with, but he gave it a try anyway. Something answered and agreed to give him the ability to craft anything he could think of with the materials available in exchange for a part of him. He agreed and now he doesn't have a last name (though that's probably only a cosmetic effect of the actual part missing).<br /> <br /> As far as looks go, he is a monkey tall as a man though with a more human face. His skin is hard and leathery and of a deep dark brown. His hair covers most of his body (including his long prehensile tail) except for his face and the palms of his four hands and is a golden brown, almost blonde (like his original hair). One of the first things he made was some sort of tunic and his faithfull spear.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":195,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","user":"Thorbes","date":". 09-17-2014, 03:45 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-18T17:15:18-07:00","id":260186,"title":"","content":"Wow, he actually seems...rather sane, compared to the three of us!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-18T17:47:19-07:00","id":260225,"title":"","content":"That he does. Oh, but there's no mystery, there. Derek used to be roughly as off-kilter, but the part he traded away included his insanity. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://avatarcomic.net/exalted-wiki/Exalted_3E:What_We_Know\" target=\"_blank\">The EX3 What We K