"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-22T15:28:45-07:00","id":263162,"title":"","content":"I have poked around <a href=\"http://www.tsemrinpoche.com/tsem-tulku-rinpoche/horoscopes/the-5-elements-of-the-chinese-zodiac.html\" target=\"_blank\">this site</a> a bit. Interesting resource, with links to write-ups on the attributed personality profiles for each animal and element pairing. Not that one has to go by those associations, but it's food for thought. I'm in a rush, but will have more to add later. For further helpful and relevant CtL fun, I also stumbled onto <a href=\"http://wodindex.wikispaces.com/Complete+Changeling+the+Lost\" target=\"_blank\">this</a>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://avatarcomic.net/exalted-wiki/Exalted_3E:What_We_Know\" target=\"_blank\">The EX3 What We Know Wiki</a>, courtesy of Marin and JMobius<br /> <a href=\"http://nishkriya.com\" target=\"_blank\">Nishkriya, the EX3 Freelancer Quotes Tracker</a>, courtesy of Anathema and Moonwolf<br /> <a href=\"http://forums.whitewolfarchive.com/\" target=\"_blank\">The White Wolf Forum Archive</a>, courtesy of The Dark Wizard and Sanctaphrax (see <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/PhilippeSaner?u=159709\" target=\"_blank\">its Patreon</a>) <hr />Arrghus: There's also the Shepherd of the North Star, busily guiding the one thing in all the heavens that <i>doesn't move</i>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/558-gaius","name":"Gaius","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2028"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-22T15:39:12-07:00","id":263168,"title":"","content":"So, according to your first link, Nate's definitely a Fire Goat, even though he should have been born a Metal one. Guess my instinct was correct!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-22T22:45:16-07:00","id":263477,"title":"","content":"Fire Goat feels like it fits Nate like a glove (solid though Metal is, too), and Wood Monkey also seems a good choice for Derek. Looking over the site also got me thinking Earth Monkey could make sense for Derek, given his pursuits: &quot;The Earth Monkey is also the least self-centred of all the Monkeys and is inclined towards charitable works. With the Earth element, he holds high principles and maintains a very strong moral code. He is forthright, honest and righteous. It won\u2019t be unusual to see him championing the rights of minorities or dedicating his life to help the downtrodden.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Thorbes</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/206054-recruitment-thread-zodiac-beasts-ooc?p=262735#post262735\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, as I see it, the zodiac beast could go either beast or elemental seeming. Elemental affinity is a key... element of the chinesse zodiac. He could just happen to be an Earth Pig. Wonder wich element is Derek the Monkey?</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/206054-recruitment-thread-zodiac-beasts-ooc?p=262966#post262966\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Indeed, the Chinese Zodiac does incorporate both an element and an animal. It's quite possible that the characters could be dual kiths. Who doesn't want to see Max chucking boulders at the next threat he comes across?</div> </div> </div> </div>Hmm... It's an interesting thought, and I'll consider it a bit more. I don't know, not sure I'm feeling an Elemental Seeming or Kith for Max, though I could definitely see him picking up a Contract in the area. The 2nd and 3rd clauses of Elements do a lot of what one might expect of an Avatar-like Bender, whereas that's not really what Kiths and Seemings tend to be about.<br /> <br /> From looking over that site, Water Pig looks like it matches Max pretty closely. His Wood Pig birth year isn't far off, either. Still, given his mood, I could see him trying to exercise some agency. He might gravitate toward things that feel like <i>his</i> choices, not stuff assigned to him by circumstance. Though it could always work out to be a bit of both or something.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Evilmarmelade</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/206054-recruitment-thread-zodiac-beasts-ooc?p=263024#post263024\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It depends. Does he still cries even while throwing boulders?<br /> <br /> <br /> Because I'd find it hilarious.</div> </div> </div> </div>Prrrrobably not the emotion he'd be going through if he became able to throw boulders. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Honestly, Max'll probably be acting less like a crybaby for one reason or another. If he gets a chance to eat, sleep, and recuperate a bit, that'll help. Much as he might also be past the point of being too tired to cry. Something like a victory would also probably tone down the weeping, more long-term. Or -- as the tension in Nate's situation suggests some sort of near-to-distant climax, and that the ranch isn't quite safe anymore -- Max might have to cut it out when things get too far into high gear for him to be able to <i>think</i> about moping.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://avatarcomic.net/exalted-wiki/Exalted_3E:What_We_Know\" target=\"_blank\">The EX3 What We Know Wiki</a>, courtesy of Marin and JMobius<br /> <a href=\"http://nishkriya.com\" target=\"_blank\">Nishkriya, the EX3 Freelancer Quotes Tracker</a>, courtesy of Anathema and Moonwolf<br /> <a href=\"http://forums.whitewolfarchive.com/\" target=\"_blank\">The White Wolf Forum Archive</a>, courtesy of The Dark Wizard and Sanctaphrax (see <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/PhilippeSaner?u=159709\" target=\"_blank\">its Patreon</a>) <hr />Arrghus: There's also the Shepherd of the North Star, busily guiding the one thing in all the heavens that <i>doesn't move</i>.","edited":{"userid":558,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/558-gaius","user":"Gaius","date":".  Elaboration! 09-23-2014, 01:52 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/558-gaius","name":"Gaius","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2028"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-23T00:57:09-07:00","id":263518,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gaius</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/206054-recruitment-thread-zodiac-beasts-ooc?p=263477#post263477\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Fire Goat feels like it fits Nate like a glove (solid though Metal is, too),</div> </div> </div> </div>Metal? I don't think so.I agree that it's close, but...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> He is kind hearted, has strong principles and a great sense of responsibility. <br /> Socially he is more comfortable with the company of close friends and family. He tends to find comfort in familiarity and dislikes changes or surprises. He\u2019ll need time to fully accept new situations and ppeople. </div> </div> </div>Yeah, noope.<br /> <br /> Besides, being a fire goat definitely feels Metal, in the music sense. Althoug it might look a little bit satanic...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-23T02:17:59-07:00","id":263543,"title":"","content":"Yeah, FireGoat is very metal. And you can take advantage of the satanic imagery and join the Winter court.<br /> <br /> Mmmm, acording to that page, Derek would be only 20 in 2014 (being born in 1994). That or he looks great for an 80 year old man. Or maybe the animal-element asociation has less to do with the birth date of the person and more with the moment the Contract was agreed upon (by buying the figurine). That could mean he bought it in 2004.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":195,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","user":"Thorbes","date":". 09-23-2014, 05:26 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-23T03:11:13-07:00","id":263566,"title":"","content":"Hm, I really don't think he's going to go Winter Court. I'm leaning toward Spring, maybe Automn. And depending how their escape goes, Summer might be under consideration.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-23T05:04:42-07:00","id":263627,"title":"","content":"Damm, I meant Autumm. The court of fear and all that. Yeah, despite his current situation I don't see Nate doing sorrow much.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-23T05:43:33-07:00","id":263668,"title":"","content":"And do you have an idea which court Derek would be most likely to join?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-23T08:29:05-07:00","id":263787,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Evilmarmelade</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/206054-recruitment-thread-zodiac-beasts-ooc?p=263518#post263518\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Besides, being a fire goat definitely feels Metal, in the music sense. Althoug it might look a little bit satanic...</div> </div> </div> </div>Depends on the type of Metal you're referring to. :P<br /> <br /> If it's Black Metal, then yes, it's satanic. The original Black Metal band even came out and said their music was about demon worship.<br /> <br /> Power Metal is about vikings, if I'm not mistaken.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-23T08:45:10-07:00","id":263795,"title":"","content":"No, I was mostly talking about a goat in flames. You know, horns and all that stuff.<br /> <br /> <br /> Well. Former horns.<br /> <br /> (And I'm more of a Folk Metal fan, which is mostly celtic or viking stuff also)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-23T14:31:52-07:00","id":264132,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Evilmarmelade</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/206054-recruitment-thread-zodiac-beasts-ooc?p=263668#post263668\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And do you have an idea which court Derek would be most likely to join?</div> </div> </div> </div>Not sure. He probably be academically interested in the concept of Contracts, so maybe Autumm as it is the court of fae magic too? I'm not seein him as a scary guy though. His entrance may suggest Summer, going spear first into problems.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-23T22:01:18-07:00","id":264387,"title":"","content":"Lessee, possible Court for Max... It probably depends a lot on circumstance, both of how the rest of his Durance goes and who he meets on the outside. Winter may be plausible for him, but... Eh, honestly, of the four, Winter is the only one I have never been able to find the least bit interesting. Summer certainly has more going on, it just doesn't seem a good fit for him. Spring's not a bad candidate, though he may worry about the statement he's making to himself: if concerned about giving into one's appetites, the Court best known for indulgence is an <i>interesting</i> choice. Fantasy fan and studious sort that he is, Autumn's probably top of the list, even if the idea of him trying to scare people is pretty funny.<br /> <br /> How about Jessica, Cire? Where do you see her falling, in terms of Elements and Courts?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://avatarcomic.net/exalted-wiki/Exalted_3E:What_We_Know\" target=\"_blank\">The EX3 What We Know Wiki</a>, courtesy of Marin and JMobius<br /> <a href=\"http://nishkriya.com\" target=\"_blank\">Nishkriya, the EX3 Freelancer Quotes Tracker</a>, courtesy of Anathema and Moonwolf<br /> <a href=\"http://forums.whitewolfarchive.com/\" target=\"_blank\">The White Wolf Forum Archive</a>, courtesy of The Dark Wizard and Sanctaphrax (see <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/PhilippeSaner?u=159709\" target=\"_blank\">its Patreon</a>) <hr />Arrghus: There's also the Shepherd of the North Star, busily guiding the one thing in all the heavens that <i>doesn't move</i>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/558-gaius","name":"Gaius","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2028"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-24T02:09:37-07:00","id":264458,"title":"","content":"If I had to guess, I'd say Summer could be a good fit for Jessica. Or Autumn. Then again, it seems like Autumn has always been one of the most popular choices for changelings, with their focus on gaining magical powers.<br /> Ans yeah, I really don't see the appeal of Winter. Maybe for Darklings and Wizened.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-24T12:45:47-07:00","id":264741,"title":"","content":"I think for Jessica, it would depend on what others did. Hmm.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-26T18:29:34-07:00","id":266544,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/206054-recruitment-thread-zodiac-beasts-ooc?p=260626#post260626\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I am planning to have them escape, yes. This is an origin story, after all.</div> </div> </div> </div>So, out of curiosity Nyrufa, do you plan on making us escape soon, or do we still have a long way to go before the end of our Durance? This is absolutely not a complaint : I just want to know if I'll have time to lay down Nate's moral changes or if I'll have to rush it, or get around it somehow. Either way is fine!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-26T18:33:03-07:00","id":266546,"title":"","content":"You guys were on the track to escaping when you were told about The Hedge... until you decided to return to the Ranch. You're durances have been understandably extended for the time being. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I like to make up the story as I go along, sure I may have a plot point down the line. But I don't like forcing people in its direction unless the story hasn't moved anywhere for a while and is getting off track.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-26T18:50:50-07:00","id":266557,"title":"","content":"Actually, I think I've figured out the loophole in our contract a long time ago, but I don't want to test it until Nate has lived a few more adventures (and maybe gained more contracts). I could be wrong of course, but there's not way to tell right now.. That's also why I got back to the Ranch.<br /> <br /> (I've also finally figured out what would be Nate's typical reaction to his fetch. It may not be pretty.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-27T05:56:41-07:00","id":266729,"title":"","content":"Oh.oh, PM me and see if we reached the same conclusion.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-27T09:28:37-07:00","id":266791,"title":"","content":"Hey there all, as this is the most recent and active Recruitment thread going, I was wondering if the game had room for a new person to join in at all? No worries if not, but if there is, if I know what slots are still going and what kind of character there's a gap for (brains, bruiser, gun-guy, face etc) I could make a character up to join with you all, if you wanted. I thought I'd ask rather than necro an older recruitment thread just to be turned down there.<br /> Of course if you guys know any other games here a new guy could volunteer for, that'd be awesome too <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3951-wander","name":"wander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"409"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-27T10:32:52-07:00","id":266836,"title":"","content":"Yay, new interest, and Nate is in the perfect place to meet up with them!<br /> <br /> Yes, we have room for more. The slots that have been taken are Pig (Gaius), Ox (Cire), Goat (Evil), and Monkey (Thorbes).<br /> <br /> That leaves Dragon, Tiger, Rooster / Chicken (depends on character gender), Rabbit, Horse, Dog, Snake, and Rat open for play.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Here's a recap, by the way, so you know what's going on:<br /> <br /> <br /> Max, Jessica and Nate (Pig, Ox, Goat) managed to escape from The Ranch (where the Zodiac collection is being stored) and quickly encountered both the beauty and the madness of Arcadia. Leo, a representative of the Western Zodiac, is attempting to help them escape because he fears losing his favored status among the Keeper's collection. Some of the western Zodiac (like Sagittarius) support him in this, while others (such as Gemini) do not. Max, Nate, and Jessica split up after having a fight. Nate and Jessica have just acquired the first level of the Contract of Fang and Talon, while Max just acquired the Contract of the Wild.<br /> <br /> Jessica met up with Derek (Monkey) and until I can think of a confrontation for them, I'm letting them play out the scene. Nate was captured by the Keeper again and is doing everything in his power to make it out of the situation alive. Max is now by himself in the woods, having received some assistance from Sagittarius.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 09-27-2014, 02:07 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-27T12:30:05-07:00","id":266952,"title":"","content":"I will def make a character to join in then!<br /> <br /> I can probably get one done for tomorrow, I could really do with knowing what there is a gap in though to steer my character that way, though I suppose a quick scan of the threads will show me where best to drift my character towards, so I'll do a bit of reading and see what would be a good add for the group along with what gels with whatever inspiration I get as I go <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3951-wander","name":"wander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"409"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-27T13:11:23-07:00","id":266964,"title":"","content":"Well from what I can gather based on what we've seen so far, the Monkey seems to be the more educated fighter of the group, the Goat is more of the anger prone brawler. The Ox is a fighter, but somewhat inexperienced, and When the Pig fights, its usually in a black out state.<br /> <br /> <br /> Despite the lots of pages we have so far, the RP is really just getting started, the characters are still getting to know one another, so we haven't had much time to display their skills and talents. As such, I can't really say we're lacking in any particular area, since we haven't seen what we have to work with yet.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-27T13:35:59-07:00","id":266969,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Evilmarmelade</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/206054-recruitment-thread-zodiac-beasts-ooc?p=266557#post266557\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Actually, I think I've figured out the loophole in our contract a long time ago, but I don't want to test it until Nate has lived a few more adventures (and maybe gained more contracts). I could be wrong of course, but there's not way to tell right now.</div> </div> </div> </div>Aye, I've had two ideas floating around for a while. One feels kind of unquestionable, but may not do a huge amount of good, though the other feels like it would be a biggie, if it turns out to be true. No sense in rushing things, though; I'd also like Max to have a few more Arcadian adventures and/or Contracts under... where his belt used to be.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> (I've also finally figured out what would be Nate's typical reaction to his fetch. It may not be pretty.) </div> </div> </div>Ah, neat. Will be looking forward to seeing that, then. I'm kinda clueless on how Max would respond. Though it might depend on the nature of his Fetch; a monstrous individual is probably going to prompt a different reaction than one who seems to have bettered the lives of everyone the pig cares about, after all.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/206054-recruitment-thread-zodiac-beasts-ooc?p=266952#post266952\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I will def make a character to join in then!<br /> <br /> I can probably get one done for tomorrow, I could really do with knowing what there is a gap in though to steer my character that way, though I suppose a quick scan of the threads will show me where best to drift my character towards, so I'll do a bit of reading and see what would be a good add for the group along with what gels with whatever inspiration I get as I go <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>We'll be glad to have you! ^_^ The game's handled freeform and the group drifts apart not infrequently, so I wouldn't worry too much about filling gaps. Just read the pitch on the first page, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/206054-recruitment-thread-zodiac-beasts-ooc?p=206597#post206597\">look</a> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/206054-recruitment-thread-zodiac-beasts-ooc?p=207849#post207849\">over</a> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/206054-recruitment-thread-zodiac-beasts-ooc?p=214883#post214883\">the</a> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/206054-recruitment-thread-zodiac-beasts-ooc?p=259111#post259111\">characters</a> when deciding on the sort of person you want, pick an unclaimed beast, and <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/205196-ic-zodiac-beasts\">dive in</a>.<br /> <br /> Also, while I still need to make one for Derek, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/206054-recruitment-thread-zodiac-beasts-ooc?p=209696#post209696\">these little things</a> have been well received.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://avatarcomic.net/exalted-wiki/Exalted_3E:What_We_Know\" target=\"_blank\">The EX3 What We Know Wiki</a>, courtesy of Marin and JMobius<br /> <a href=\"http://nishkriya.com\" target=\"_blank\">Nishkriya, the EX3 Freelancer Quotes Tracker</a>, courtesy of Anathema and Moonwolf<br /> <a href=\"http://forums.whitewolfarchive.com/\" target=\"_blank\">The White Wolf Forum Archive</a>, courtesy of The Dark Wizard and Sanctaphrax (see <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/PhilippeSaner?u=159709\" target=\"_blank\">its Patreon</a>) <hr />Arrghus: There's also the Shepherd of the North Star, busily guiding the one thing in all the heavens that <i>doesn't move</i>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/558-gaius","name":"Gaius","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2028"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-27T14:48:03-07:00","id":267020,"title":"","content":"I'm feeling a Nix as my Beast Seeming, there's alot of Fighters here and I'm thinking I'm going to make physical skill dots secondary if basing the free-form off character sheets is a thing, Social would be my Primary, but centred on Presence rather than Manipulation, a face but not a puppeteer... So I guess that'll make my character mostly sensibly the Snake of the Zodiac <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> I figured in a group of fighters someone that can sweet-talk and also talk down or intimidate people is a good call to not step on other's toes!<br /> <br /> Thats just an initial look over the Beast Kiths though and a way to decide what Zodiac sign I'd take (without considering a Dual-Kith)... I'd probably specialise in Weaponry and Firearms also, just to add something new to the table. I am still checking out the IC thread so things will likely change and be more fully formed tomorrow, but I just wanted to let you guys see my initial thoughts as is.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3951-wander","name":"wander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"409"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-27T15:28:51-07:00","id":267033,"title":"","content":"I think you may have misread Nyrufa's meaning. He wasn't saying they're all fighters, skipping out on social and mental stuff. He was saying that to date, when they've gotten into combat -- generally having been surprised or otherwise prevented from thinking/talking their way out -- that's how they've defended themselves. For instance, Max has had some martial arts training, but his first inclination is definitely not to throw down with someone or something. If I were to stat him up, he'd probably have Social or Mental in his primary area.<br /> <br /> On which note, just remember that this is a freeform game. Which is not to say there's anything wrong with statting up the character or thinking in mechanical terms: it can be a fun exercise and can help some people get a feel for a character. If that sounds like you, then rock on! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Just noting that we've not really referred to or thought about the mechanics, for the most part.<br /> <br /> I also have a concern that last paragraph may come off as kinda condescending: there's a good chance you already got that. xD Apologies if I've been insulting! Just figured I'd lob it out as a &quot;just in case&quot; deal.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://avatarcomic.net/exalted-wiki/Exalted_3E:What_We_Know\" target=\"_blank\">The EX3 What We Know Wiki</a>, courtesy of Marin and JMobius<br /> <a href=\"http://nishkriya.com\" target=\"_blank\">Nishkriya, the EX3 Freelancer Quotes Tracker</a>, courtesy of Anathema and Moonwolf<br /> <a href=\"http://forums.whitewolfarchive.com/\" target=\"_blank\">The White Wolf Forum Archive</a>, courtesy of The Dark Wizard and Sanctaphrax (see <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/PhilippeSaner?u=159709\" target=\"_blank\">its Patreon</a>) <hr />Arrghus: There's also the Shepherd of the North Star, busily guiding the one thing in all the heavens that <i>doesn't move</i>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/558-gaius","name":"Gaius","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2028"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-27T18:07:10-07:00","id":267093,"title":"","content":"Welcome Wander, and glad to see that you're so eager on joining us!<br /> <br /> So, Nyrufa : I really have no idea on the quality of Nate's music. The obvious answer would be to declare it to be terrible, as he never played the pan flutes. However, it's a magical realm, and maybe this knowledge came with his new form. Or maybe it's just okay.<br /> So, I'm sorry to give my burden to you, but I'll leave you to decide, if that's okay with you! I'll be cool with any decision you make. Thanks.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-27T19:22:34-07:00","id":267134,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Evilmarmelade</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/206054-recruitment-thread-zodiac-beasts-ooc?p=267093#post267093\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Welcome Wander, and glad to see that you're so eager on joining us!<br /> <br /> So, Nyrufa : I really have no idea on the quality of Nate's music. The obvious answer would be to declare it to be terrible, as he never played the pan flutes. However, it's a magical realm, and maybe this knowledge came with his new form. Or maybe it's just okay.<br /> So, I'm sorry to give my burden to you, but I'll leave you to decide, if that's okay with you! I'll be cool with any decision you make. Thanks.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hmmm, well if Arcadia is the stuff of nightmares and dreams, maybe playing music works differently than in the real world. Maybe it's more about visualizing the notes in your mind than actually knowing how to play the instrument, and then over time Musicians learn how to tap into this power at will in the form of their blessing? I highly doubt any mundane musician would have the talent to amuse a Keeper who bends the very fabric of creation to their whim, but if they could play music with their thoughts rather than their fingers, that makes more sense.<br /> <br /> <br /> ------------------------<br /> <br /> Also, you don't need to worry too much about stats. Free Form RP's are designed more towards using one's imagination and is good for helping improve one's story writing talents. It's how I first got into RPing and is the type I have the most experience with. That by no means is saying you can't tell us your stats, of course, but they can be summarized pretty easily with the character's back story. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> One more thing to note is that Derrek (Monkey) made a reference to the snake being female in an earlier post, but we can ret-con that if you wish.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 09-27-2014, 10:25 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-28T05:34:33-07:00","id":267344,"title":"","content":"All right. I edited my post with your suggestions. Tell me if Nate's experience with the flute sounds too... easy, or far-fetched.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-28T09:28:52-07:00","id":267455,"title":"","content":"Cire, sorry to have you waiting so long, and welcome to the new player!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-28T11:27:05-07:00","id":267539,"title":"","content":"No worries for the Snake being a female... I was erring on being at the very least effeminate as they were a Nix, so thats fine! Good to hear that I don't need to worry too much about stats, makes my work finish up all the quicker, heh... So I'm for sure going with a Nix and seeing as things are roughly grounded in Arcadia I'm feeling an expertise in Fencing or general weaponry... Maybe having a sword called 'Forked Tongue' when combat occurs? Not sure there'd be anything otherwise special about it though, I don't want to imbalance the party/motley.<br /> <br /> So their birth date would be '89, that would make them 25 years old if we're going with this year? I'm still working on a background I like and wondering where best to fit in... Names are always hardest for me though. If there was some more characterisation mentioned for Ms.Snake that'd be awesome to integrate into what I'm building up <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3951-wander","name":"wander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"409"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-28T11:43:46-07:00","id":267548,"title":"","content":"Nate (aka, me) mentioned that he feels uneasy when talking to the Snake, the Tiger or the Dragon, but it's mostly because of their species.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":2016,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","user":"Evilmarmelade","date":". 09-28-2014, 02:57 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-28T13:01:57-07:00","id":267620,"title":"","content":"Derek mentioned that the Snake seemed to have adapted quite fine to her new condition, embracing it. She also had a tongue as sharp as a sword.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-28T19:43:09-07:00","id":267877,"title":"","content":"Cool, works well with me picking Nix and wanting to be a more social animal <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I have a name half-way there and a background is slowly forming up... I think as soon as I can figure exactly what she was occupationally when she got taken into Arcadia it's gonna all fall into place. I'm being pulled towards her being a bit of a corporate lady and someone possibly high-paid but I'm erring against that... I wanted my character to be someone likeable when thought about, even though she'd be quick-witted and ready with snappy come-backs, she'd be someone you want to get behind rather than being seen as an antagonist... I can picture her being a bit of a smart-alec... I'm getting there, slowly... Heh.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3951-wander","name":"wander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"409"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-28T20:10:39-07:00","id":267893,"title":"","content":"Remember, this is an origin story. It tells what your characters went through in their Durances. If you have trouble with certain ideas, we can flesh those out through the course of the RP. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-29T11:39:46-07:00","id":268407,"title":"","content":"Okay, well I have this so far;<br /> <br /> Name: Emilia Valentina Angelique<br /> <br /> Age: 25<br /> <br /> Kith: Nix<br /> <br /> Background: tbc.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3951-wander","name":"wander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"409"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-29T11:48:51-07:00","id":268415,"title":"","content":"Oh, and remember that we do not need to all come from the same city, or even country. In fact, Nate, Jessica and Max come from all over the US.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-29T12:27:22-07:00","id":268461,"title":"","content":"I think it is great that Wander's character was un-knowingly foreshadowed!<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-29T15:06:34-07:00","id":268564,"title":"","content":"I'm going to leave Eva's (she hates being called Emilia, btw... see what I did there? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />) homeplace to be handwaved or for the others to try and guess it... I'm not from the US and whilst I can name cities and places, I don't know much to actually give many references...<br /> I'm feeling right now my character as a latina lady, a gifted cat-burglar or some kind of larcenous role, a collector of artworks which is likely why she picked up the snake statue to go with the rest of her pieces... Someone gifted to sneak into a place, get to what she needs and lift the thing and get out. Slight academic bent, though not too much, she's more a female Errol Flynn kinda gal. I'm picturing the old version of Lara Croft now a little, maybe not so affluent, though that kind of feel that she's learned, but more from what she has been doing than what school had taught her. She is likely following a family tradition from some old uncle mentor who was a bit of a treasure hunter and thief... He took her under her wing until she could branch out on her own and as she grew and left her teens behind she become quite gifted at gaining her collection... Until she snagged that snake statue from that mysterious shop keeper and landed where she is now <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> If thats okay to go with (please feel free to ask questions or let me know if something should be more developed), where best should I place Eva and what would she likely have been doing before then whilst the others have been doing their thing? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3951-wander","name":"wander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"409"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-29T16:08:35-07:00","id":268589,"title":"","content":"Right now, we're all converging back to the Ranch. Nate is already there, playing music to save his life. Derek and Jessica are just about to arrive, and Max is slowly heading there. As for what she's been doing...Nyrufa has posted a rather complete recap of the events, if you want to take a look at what we've done.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-29T17:38:18-07:00","id":268637,"title":"","content":"Any objections to Eva turning up at the Ranch and maybe getting some chatting in with Nate? Or is there someone who is more active and would like the company? I won't be IC posting until sometime probably about 12 hours from now or more, as sleep and my daily routine will be following when I log off now, but I figure it gives a good amount of time for our friendly ST to see how things are and if anyone else would like to meet the new character <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Until then, I shall be off <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3951-wander","name":"wander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"409"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-29T18:19:55-07:00","id":268649,"title":"","content":"No objection on my part, but Nate's waiting for the Keeper to pronounce his verdict. Maybe he'll be carried away to the Butcher's shop, maybe not!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-29T19:15:31-07:00","id":268696,"title":"","content":"Nate is actually at the Ranch right now. So if you appear there, you can immediately meet up with him. The others are wandering somewhere in the wilderness and may take a while to locate. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-29T19:37:07-07:00","id":268707,"title":"","content":"If Eva's been at the Ranch, there's a good chance she's in audience around Nate's performance. Reading the whole thread might be a good idea, but you should definitely read Evilmar's and Nyrufa's posts starting <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/205196-ic-zodiac-beasts?p=261466#post261466\">here</a>. Needless to say, going right up to talk to Nate while the Keeper's still dealing with him <i>might</i> be a bad idea. ^_^o Unless Eva's got a thing for being made into snakeskin boots or something. Still, chatting him up after Nyrufa gives an opening should be A-OK.<br /> <br /> As for other options, Derek and Jessica just got back to the Ranch, too, so socializing with them is certainly open, even if the Keeper sweeps Nate off somewhere. For a more solo endeavor, Eva could be somewhere else on the Ranch, or might have wandered off into the surrounding Arcadia, looking for a way out and snagging a solo adventure of her own. The last prominent possibility is that she might have left the Ranch, and might bump into Max, who's still sort of wandering. The pig's mostly looking for something to eat at this point, but his wanderings could just return him to the Ranch, should Nyrufa feel like bringing the whole band in one place. Should be fun, regardless. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://avatarcomic.net/exalted-wiki/Exalted_3E:What_We_Know\" target=\"_blank\">The EX3 What We Know Wiki</a>, courtesy of Marin and JMobius<br /> <a href=\"http://nishkriya.com\" target=\"_blank\">Nishkriya, the EX3 Freelancer Quotes Tracker</a>, courtesy of Anathema and Moonwolf<br /> <a href=\"http://forums.whitewolfarchive.com/\" target=\"_blank\">The White Wolf Forum Archive</a>, courtesy of The Dark Wizard and Sanctaphrax (see <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/PhilippeSaner?u=159709\" target=\"_blank\">its Patreon</a>) <hr />Arrghus: There's also the Shepherd of the North Star, busily guiding the one thing in all the heavens that <i>doesn't move</i>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/558-gaius","name":"Gaius","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2028"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-30T02:25:21-07:00","id":268875,"title":"","content":"And technically, Derek and Eva have already met.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-30T03:55:34-07:00","id":268928,"title":"","content":"Well, I have already decided Derek has the Enciclopedic Knowledge Merit... on top of a ton of Academics and Occult.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-30T04:00:55-07:00","id":268951,"title":"","content":"Oh great. Another reason for Nate not to like him. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-30T06:11:25-07:00","id":268975,"title":"","content":"Hey, he's a college professor, he ought to have some of those!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-30T07:40:35-07:00","id":269021,"title":"","content":"Okay, I'll be waiting for our friendly ST to get back to see how the performance went and how the Keeper took it <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> One last question and I think depending on if the ST is cool with it, I'll be jumping in... I was wondering about clothes... Are the Zodiacs currently in any? Are we still in the rags of our former mortal clothes or have we been given some Arcadian bits to wear? I haven't really seen much reference to clothing and I felt it would be good to know what others were dressed in, if they were dressed to make a better introductory post and make it last a little bit.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3951-wander","name":"wander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"409"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-30T08:08:59-07:00","id":269072,"title":"","content":"The characters began with the clothes they had when they were human, although they are tattered and ruined as a result of their transformation. Some of our players ended up losing these destroyed rags on their adventure through the forest, although Jessica has acquired some replacements with Derek's help. The Keeper views you as beasts, so I doubt he'll care much about garbing you... it's like putting a sweater on a dog!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-30T08:24:14-07:00","id":269101,"title":"","content":"Nate is naked, and doesn't care anymore. Since he made the contract of Fang and Talon, putting clothes seems...wrong to him. Besides, he has enough fur to keep him warm.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":2016,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","user":"Evilmarmelade","date":". 09-30-2014, 11:26 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-30T09:12:33-07:00","id":269142,"title":"","content":"Max is also naked, and will be very self-conscious about it, once he's had a chance to work his way down to it on his priority list. Items above it include, in no particular order, sleep, food, and avoiding becoming food. Though at least having signed the Contract of the Wilds he's at least perfectly comfortable in the nude.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Ah, good, Nate's performance went over well. For the moment. ^_^o Here's hoping that keeps up.<br /> <br /> Nyrufa, planning to edit in where Max has wound up?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://avatarcomic.net/exalted-wiki/Exalted_3E:What_We_Know\" target=\"_blank\">The EX3 What We Know Wiki</a>, courtesy of Marin and JMobius<br /> <a href=\"http://nishkriya.com\" target=\"_blank\">Nishkriya, the EX3 Freelancer Quotes Tracker</a>, courtesy of Anathema and Moonwolf<br /> <a href=\"http://forums.whitewolfarchive.com/\" target=\"_blank\">The White Wolf Forum Archive</a>, courtesy of The Dark Wizard and Sanctaphrax (see <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/PhilippeSaner?u=159709\" target=\"_blank\">its Patreon</a>) <hr />Arrghus: There's also the Shepherd of the North Star, busily guiding the one thing in all the heavens that <i>doesn't move</i>.","edited":{"userid":558,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/558-gaius","user":"Gaius","date":". 09-30-2014, 12:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/558-gaius","name":"Gaius","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2028"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-30T09:42:55-07:00","id":269203,"title":"","content":"Sorry about that. Also, I was waiting for Wander to get his character fleshed out before we continued. Didn't want to accidentally move too far ahead and lose his chance to meet up with the others.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-30T09:54:49-07:00","id":269214,"title":"","content":"No worries. My request sounds a bit snippy in hindsight, so sorry about that.<br /> <br /> And aye, I hear you. No rush.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://avatarcomic.net/exalted-wiki/Exalted_3E:What_We_Know\" target=\"_blank\">The EX3 What We Know Wiki</a>, courtesy of Marin and JMobius<br /> <a href=\"http://nishkriya.com\" target=\"_blank\">Nishkriya, the EX3 Freelancer Quotes Tracker</a>, courtesy of Anathema and Moonwolf<br /> <a href=\"http://forums.whitewolfarchive.com/\" target=\"_blank\">The White Wolf Forum Archive</a>, courtesy of The Dark Wizard and Sanctaphrax (see <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/PhilippeSaner?u=159709\" target=\"_blank\">its Patreon</a>) <hr />Arrghus: There's also the Shepherd of the North Star, busily guiding the one thing in all the heavens that <i>doesn't move</i>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/558-gaius","name":"Gaius","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2028"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-30T10:21:18-07:00","id":269244,"title":"","content":"Looks like Nate's now forced to provide the soundtrack for the Ranch!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-30T10:44:06-07:00","id":269257,"title":"","content":"Seems the case. Still, probably preferable to providing meat and leather.<br /> <br /> ... Or so I'd have said for sure before reading. ^_^o Yeah, that's a pretty harsh emotional wringer to put oneself through. Poor Nate.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://avatarcomic.net/exalted-wiki/Exalted_3E:What_We_Know\" target=\"_blank\">The EX3 What We Know Wiki</a>, courtesy of Marin and JMobius<br /> <a href=\"http://nishkriya.com\" target=\"_blank\">Nishkriya, the EX3 Freelancer Quotes Tracker</a>, courtesy of Anathema and Moonwolf<br /> <a href=\"http://forums.whitewolfarchive.com/\" target=\"_blank\">The White Wolf Forum Archive</a>, courtesy of The Dark Wizard and Sanctaphrax (see <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/PhilippeSaner?u=159709\" target=\"_blank\">its Patreon</a>) <hr />Arrghus: There's also the Shepherd of the North Star, busily guiding the one thing in all the heavens that <i>doesn't move</i>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/558-gaius","name":"Gaius","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2028"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-30T10:57:49-07:00","id":269265,"title":"","content":"The pressure got to him, and right in front of everyone. He needed to be broken a bit.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-30T11:07:08-07:00","id":269295,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Thorbes</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/206054-recruitment-thread-zodiac-beasts-ooc?p=268928#post268928\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, I have already decided Derek has the Enciclopedic Knowledge Merit... on top of a ton of Academics and Occult.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sort of reminds me of Doctor Eric Webster (Cire). I wonder if he has a cat!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-30T11:10:17-07:00","id":269297,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Evilmarmelade</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/206054-recruitment-thread-zodiac-beasts-ooc?p=269265#post269265\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The pressure got to him, and right in front of everyone. He needed to be broken a bit.</div> </div> </div> </div>Suck it up! The Keeper isn't interested in your bitching. Now play, play for him, little goat! Make your master happy...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-30T11:13:23-07:00","id":269298,"title":"","content":"Oh god, the Keeper is like the worst internet troll. &quot;Don't care about your life problems, you suxx! You're not funny anymore. unsuscribe kthxbye!&quot;<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://media.tumblr.com/tumblr_lrxcxsJPHl1qfx4op.gif\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":2016,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","user":"Evilmarmelade","date":". 09-30-2014, 02:39 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-30T13:30:15-07:00","id":269421,"title":"","content":"I feel like my character is pretty much fleshed out to at least get into the game, being a kind of art-thief and having an old mentor that led them into that life once they left school. Other little details I'll probably add as I find the character's voice... I just wanted to know if the characters are clothed (I know now! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />) and if there was anything in particular the ST wanted from me background-wise. Tbh I'm ready to post as soon as the ST says I can, though now I feel they want me to add a little more to backstory, which I can... If I knew exactly what they'd like me to add, hehe...<br /> <br /> Sadly I was very much ready to add in an introductory IC post about now... I guess I'll let this scene move out a bit more (as I really don't wanna feel responsible for holding the rest of you guys up with this) and when I know what the ST is wanting, I can always get my into up a little later on <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3951-wander","name":"wander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"409"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-30T13:58:00-07:00","id":269474,"title":"","content":"Maybe you can appear suddenly between Derek and Jessica now that she decided to share his plan. Or be hanging out on the fruit tree Max is next too. Derek mentioned being with the snake on a tree before leaving her.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-30T14:05:18-07:00","id":269483,"title":"","content":"You can go ahead and post any time, Wander.<br /> <br /> Your background can be just about anything. The one thing all the players have in common is that they bought a golden figurine from this Keeper's shop, thus signing a contract to come to Arcadia without even realizing it. Beyond that coincidence, they're completely random people who had the misfortune of being the first customer to purchase each statue. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-30T14:09:55-07:00","id":269484,"title":"","content":"Or you could be among the audience, watching Nate being harassed by the Keeper.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-30T14:54:19-07:00","id":269512,"title":"","content":"There's always that option, yes. By default it seems all the Zodiac is there, save some honorable exceptions <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Also, the Keeper is thinking about Derek too much for the poor monkey's comfort <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-30T15:21:50-07:00","id":269530,"title":"","content":"Oh by the way wander. The Horse is missing : it seems that it's the only animal that was allowed to leave. We think it's because 2014 is the year of the horse.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-30T15:59:35-07:00","id":269578,"title":"","content":"Yeah, we kind of forgot to mention that. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/redface.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Embarrassment\" smilieid=\"2\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-01T05:24:17-07:00","id":270073,"title":"","content":"Cool, I gotta jet out now, but I hope to get a bit of time later this evening to get an intro post up then <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Keep on going guys, I will be with you all in a couple of hours <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3951-wander","name":"wander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"409"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-01T22:07:18-07:00","id":270612,"title":"","content":"Apologies for the huge post just now. o_o That one just kinda kept going...<br /> <br /> In any case, looking forward to the entry of the serpentine lady, wander!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://avatarcomic.net/exalted-wiki/Exalted_3E:What_We_Know\" target=\"_blank\">The EX3 What We Know Wiki</a>, courtesy of Marin and JMobius<br /> <a href=\"http://nishkriya.com\" target=\"_blank\">Nishkriya, the EX3 Freelancer Quotes Tracker</a>, courtesy of Anathema and Moonwolf<br /> <a href=\"http://forums.whitewolfarchive.com/\" target=\"_blank\">The White Wolf Forum Archive</a>, courtesy of The Dark Wizard and Sanctaphrax (see <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/PhilippeSaner?u=159709\" target=\"_blank\">its Patreon</a>) <hr />Arrghus: There's also the Shepherd of the North Star, busily guiding the one thing in all the heavens that <i>doesn't move</i>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/558-gaius","name":"Gaius","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2028"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-01T22:41:29-07:00","id":270623,"title":"","content":"I, for one, loved it. Maybe because it was so well written it did not seem long to me. A great thing when our characters are alone is how we can go a bit further. You took fuul advantage of that and I loved it<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-02T03:22:52-07:00","id":270677,"title":"","content":"Aaaaw, Max is just so nice. You know, I really felt bad when I had Nate yelling at him!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":2016,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","user":"Evilmarmelade","date":". 10-02-2014, 08:56 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-02T14:25:05-07:00","id":271114,"title":"","content":"I am still around guys! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I was going to post just now, but I think I'm going to wait for Mr.Goat and the Keeper to close up or for something to happen that I feel I could react to and plop some dialogue in the post... I felt doing a brief post about Eva's thoughts of the goat's pan-pipe work would be a bit anti-climactic, so when I see my chance I'm gonna take it and write something really cool <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3951-wander","name":"wander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"409"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-02T17:44:53-07:00","id":271256,"title":"","content":"Actually I've been wanting you to post for a while. I'm eager to see how our snake will view the situation. Maybe her presence distracts the Keeper and he loses interest in Nate before going off to do... keeper things until he remembers what he was doing. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-02T18:12:23-07:00","id":271276,"title":"","content":"I don't care who post first. The suspense is killing me! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-03T13:39:40-07:00","id":271718,"title":"","content":"Posted... Its not too much past some thoughts and there was zero dialogue, but now I'm in the tale, I expect people will be paying notice of my character and I'll soon have more to interact with in future <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3951-wander","name":"wander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"409"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-05T04:05:06-07:00","id":272827,"title":"","content":"Well, i don't really expect Nate to notice you right now, so I'll have to wait for Nyrufa's intervention, or maybe Derek and Jessica, if they come too close to the ranch. x)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-05T09:43:42-07:00","id":272977,"title":"","content":"Hehe, good to hear... Just when I thought my IC post killed the game! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3951-wander","name":"wander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"409"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-06T03:02:34-07:00","id":273551,"title":"","content":"Not at all! I think Jessica and Derek are going to have a serious conversation and that may decide what their next move will be. I don't think Derek would be too keen on leting <i>anyone</i> behind in this madhause though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-06T09:08:28-07:00","id":273913,"title":"","content":"So, just a heads-up everyone : I'll be going on a Larp next weekend, so i won't be able to post. I'll be leaving friday in the afternoon, and I should be back by sunday evenight.<br /> <br /> And while we're not there yet, might as well mention it : I'll also be away on another larp in two weeks, from Thursday 23th to Monday 27th. I'm organizing this one, that's why I'll be gone longer. Fell free to go on without me. ^^","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-06T13:48:10-07:00","id":274149,"title":"","content":"Have lots of fun!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-06T15:56:54-07:00","id":274227,"title":"","content":"@Evilmarmelade: Thanks for the heads up. Have a blast!<br /> <br /> On a related note, I may not be so active this weekend or the weekend of the 31st: I'll be taking trips out of town for a coupla gatherings with old friends.<br /> <br /> @wander: Aye, it definitely wasn't you. Real life just sidelines all of us every once in a while; I'm sure Nyrufa will post when he gets the chance. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Also, nice intro.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:9px\">... Also, belated thanks for the compliments. ^__^</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://avatarcomic.net/exalted-wiki/Exalted_3E:What_We_Know\" target=\"_blank\">The EX3 What We Know Wiki</a>, courtesy of Marin and JMobius<br /> <a href=\"http://nishkriya.com\" target=\"_blank\">Nishkriya, the EX3 Freelancer Quotes Tracker</a>, courtesy of Anathema and Moonwolf<br /> <a href=\"http://forums.whitewolfarchive.com/\" target=\"_blank\">The White Wolf Forum Archive</a>, courtesy of The Dark Wizard and Sanctaphrax (see <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/PhilippeSaner?u=159709\" target=\"_blank\">its Patreon</a>) <hr />Arrghus: There's also the Shepherd of the North Star, busily guiding the one thing in all the heavens that <i>doesn't move</i>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/558-gaius",