ope you forgive me for bringing everybody to the same place by such a Deus ex Machina but is always easier to start with everybody in the same place even if later you drift appart. You are in an sort of court, so you should be able to discuss, amend and object to any Contract up to this point (yes, including that one). Ball is your camp now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-07T14:42:19-08:00","id":362889,"title":"","content":"Thanks for picking this game up. Sorry for being so slow to answer with such a short post, things have been a bit crazy here today.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-07T22:13:27-08:00","id":363209,"title":"","content":"Aye, thank you for starting things off again, Thorbes. ^_^ Looks like a good set-up for the fresh beginning.<br /> <br /> And don't feel too bad, EvilMarmelade. This week is kinda nuts for me, too. @_@ Apologies in advance everybody, but I may be a little while. I'll see what I can do about posting by Friday, but wow.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-d