eonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-30T02:17:09-07:00","id":682841,"title":"","content":"I'm mostly good for now. My boss is laying off my back a bit, and if all goes well, I'll have my own place this weekend.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-02T22:21:45-07:00","id":686527,"title":"","content":"@Thorbes &amp; Evilmarmelade: Glad things have eased up on the both of you. ^_^<br /> <br /> @Nyrufa: Aye, there are a number of reasons freeform was a good for this game, and I'd agree, &quot;Suddenly: everyone is busy!&quot; was one of them.<br /> <br /> For my part, my company's coming out of September, so the end-of-quarter onslaught is (in theory) complete. Now, to begin making up for work we were too tied up to do for a while! I have some concerns about my quarterly review next week, but that's a bridge to cross when it comes.<br /> <br /> @Cire: Considering the last word you gave us, you're likely not in a position to reply, or maybe even read this. :/ Even so, when you do, I hope you've been well, despite the shortage of computer access!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://avatarcomic.net/exalted-wiki/Exalted_3E:What_We_Know\" target=\"_blank\">The EX3 What We Know Wiki</a>, courtesy of Marin and JMobius